        {
          "type": "starrailexpress:role_effects",
          "parameters": {
            "lines": [
              {
                "en_us": "- Family Portrait (one per match, right-click two Killer players or a Magician to form a family! Each member gets 30% of the other two's combined coins; after everyone dies, Niaoshoushou revives in a random room with Speed II and one incendiary);",
